# Inbox
Your inbox in an org:  the messages people in it send you, and the pages its Managers send.
Where it's kept is in Inbox.api.spell, and only its first line knows.
A message lands in each inbox it's to, so deleting yours leaves theirs;  it can't be changed once it's sent.


## A row for each:  who it's from, what it says, and its conversation

<spell-more-of "message">
	<draw>
		<segment class="message">
			<stack spacing="sm">
				<stack direction="horizontal" spacing="md" align="center" wrap>
					<text class="from">{its from}</text>
					<text class="to" color="grey">to {its recipients}</text>
					<text class="sent" color="grey">{its sent}</text>
					<button class="remove" icon="close" size="mini" appearance="transparent" aria-label="Delete your copy" title="Delete your copy:  everyone else keeps theirs" onClick={remove it from the messages}/>
				</stack>
				<text class="text">{its text}</text>
				<text class="title">{its title}</text>
				<text class="line" color="grey">{its line}</text>
				<text class="page" color="grey">{its page}</text>
			</stack>
		</segment>
	</draw>
</spell-more-of>


## How you hear of it, by mail:  pick one

<spell-more-of "mail choice">
	<draw>
		<form value={it} class="mail-choice">
			<field label="Mail me" inline>
				<select name="how">
					<item value="each">One mail per message</item>
					<item value="digest">A daily digest</item>
					<item value="none">No mail</item>
				</select>
			</field>
		</form>
	</draw>
</spell-more-of>


## A space you follow, and a button to stop

<spell-more-of "subscription">
	<draw>
		<stack class="subscription" direction="horizontal" spacing="md" align="center">
			<text>{its space}</text>
			<button class="unsubscribe" icon="close" size="mini" appearance="transparent" aria-label="Stop following it" title="Stop following it" onClick={remove it from the subscriptions}/>
		</stack>
	</draw>
</spell-more-of>


## The page:  write one, then every message, newest first, each with a Reply

<spell-app "inbox page">
	<property "new message">a new message</>
	<property "new subscription">a new subscription</>

	<action "send it">
		add the new message to the messages
		set its new message to a new message
	</action>

	<action "reply to (who as text) in (conversation as text)">
		set the recipients of the new message to who
		set the thread of the new message to conversation
	</action>

	<action "choose how">
		add a new mail choice whose how is "digest" to the mail choices
	</action>

	<action "subscribe">
		add the new subscription to the subscriptions
		set its new subscription to a new subscription
	</action>

	<draw>
		<container class="inbox">
			<stack>
				<header size="large">Your inbox</header>
				<text class="who-reads" color="grey">The org's Board and its Admins can read your inbox, as they can every space in the org.</text>

				<segment class="write">
					<header size="medium">Write to someone</header>
					<form value={its new message}>
						<stack spacing="sm">
							<input name="recipients" placeholder="bo@rs, cy@rs" aria-label="Who it's to, by their address" fluid/>
							<input name="text" placeholder="What you'd like to say" aria-label="Your message" fluid/>
							<input name="thread" placeholder="A conversation to answer in, if any" aria-label="The conversation it answers" fluid/>
							<button class="send" color="primary" disabled={the recipients of the new message is ""} onClick={send it}>Send</button>
						</stack>
					</form>
				</segment>

				<segment class="mail">
					<header size="medium">Mail</header>
					<stack class="mail-choices" spacing="sm">
						<for choice in every mail choice loading="Reading how you hear of it">
							<empty>
								<stack direction="horizontal" spacing="md" align="center" wrap>
									<text color="grey">A daily digest of what's new, each morning.</text>
									<button class="choose" size="small" onClick={choose how}>Choose</button>
								</stack>
							</empty>
						</for>
					</stack>
				</segment>

				<segment class="subscriptions">
					<header size="medium">Spaces you follow</header>
					<form value={its new subscription}>
						<input name="space" placeholder="events_team@rs" aria-label="A shared space of the org, by its address" fluid action>
							<button slot="action" color="primary" disabled={the space of the new subscription is ""} onClick={subscribe}>Follow</button>
						</input>
					</form>
					<stack class="subscription-list" spacing="sm">
						<for subscription in every subscription>
							<empty><text color="grey">None yet.</text></empty>
						</for>
					</stack>
				</segment>

				<segment class="messages">
					<header size="medium">Conversations</header>
					<stack class="message-list" spacing="sm">
						<for message in every message sorted by its sent newest first loading="Reading your inbox">
							<stack class="row" spacing="xs">
								<message/>
								<button class="reply" icon="reply" size="small" appearance="basic" title="Answer in this conversation:  fills in who it's to and the conversation" onClick={reply to the from of message in the thread of message}>Reply</button>
							</stack>
							<empty><text class="none" color="grey">Nothing yet.</text></empty>
							<failed><text color="red">We can't read your inbox right now.</text></failed>
						</for>
					</stack>
				</segment>
			</stack>
		</container>
	</draw>
</spell-app>
